      "writtenOn": "2025-01-09T20:09:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh great, yeah for `SdkSandbox` it was mostly just internal/external source skew. That should be resolved now so I\u0027d be comfortable relaxing the opt-out directly without a build flag. \n\nFor bluetooth, I think the issue was primarily with tests and mocking, b/289285719. That we may also be able to resolve without needing a build flag.",
